    </p>

    <div class="ok-box">
      <strong>Status:</strong> Live update complete —
      <strong>5,161</strong> variants updated successfully (including 4 that were retried after a brief connection error).
      <strong>47</strong> variants were left unchanged because size could not be parsed (mostly round rugs, e.g. “160cm Round”).
    </div>

