    <h2>What we did</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Exported a full price backup of the live catalog (<code>backup.csv</code>).</li>
      <li>For each variant, read the size (e.g. <code>160x230cm</code>), took the <strong>lowest</strong> side as package length, and looked up freight from your table (ex GST).</li>
      <li>Added that freight amount to the existing variant price.</li>
      <li>Pushed the new prices to Shopify via Admin API — <strong>no theme code change</strong> required for the price hike itself.</li>
      <li>Retried the one product that failed on a temporary connection error; all planned rows are now live.</li>
    </ol>

